WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Here is a tiny seed resting quietly in the soil.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.200
After a drink of water, a little root grows down.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.900
Then a green shoot grows up toward the warm sunlight.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.600
The first leaves open! The seed is becoming a little plant.
